/**
 * @mainpage Keyple Card Generic C++ Library
 *
 * @section overview Overview
 *
 * The **Keyple Card Generic C++ Library** is a Keyple add-on that enables
 * applications to interact with any type of card through low level APDU
 * commands, providing direct control over card communication.
 *
 * @section key_features Key Features
 *
 * - Low-level APDU command support
 * - Generic card communication interface
 * - Direct control over card operations
 * - Support for any card type and protocol
 * - Flexible command and response handling
 *
 * @section resources Resources
 *
 * - **Documentation**: [keyple.org](https://keyple.org)
 * - **API Documentation**: [docs.keyple.org/keyple-card-generic-cpp-lib](https://docs.keyple.org/keyple-card-generic-cpp-lib)
 * - **Examples**: [github.com/eclipse/keyple-cpp-example](https://github.com/eclipse/keyple-cpp-example)
 */
